query sucker is:
    which person is a sucker.

query which_may_vote_at_years_of_age is:
    which person may vote at which number years of age.

query which_must_pay_taxes_at_years_of_age is:
    which person must pay taxes at which number years of age.

query which_is_a_sucker is:
    which person is a sucker.

the view the act is:
    the title is "Sucker Act, as Blawx encodes it".
    the case is a scenario, with the documents it is stated in.
    the facts about "the case" are
        a person is a person,
        a person is a number years of age.
    the result is the answer to query which_must_pay_taxes_at_years_of_age.
    the result shows its reasons.
    the result shows its citations.
    the result can be flipped.

